    A separate file, because {% extends %} compiles the complete parent template. An
    inline importmap() call in layout.html.twig is a parse error on a host that has no
    AssetMapper, even when that host overrides {% block scripts %}. include() resolves
    at render time, so a host that overrides the scripts block never compiles this file.
#}
